                    <p>The Oracle Cloud Infrastructure (OCI) AI Foundations=
 certification is designed to introduce learners to the fundamental concept=
s of artificial intelligence (AI) and machine learning (ML), with a specifi=
c focus on the practical application of these technologies within the Oracl=
e Cloud Infrastructure. This course is ideal for beginners and provides an =
accessible entry point for those looking to enhance their understanding of =
AI and ML without the requirement of prior extensive technical experience.<=
/p><p><b>Expiration Date:</b> September 02, 2027
                  </p></div>
